<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Krish Tech</title>

    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        font-family: Inter, Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #0b1120;
        color: white;
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }

      a {
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .container {
        width: 90%;
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: auto;
      }

      nav {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 100;

        background: rgba(11, 17, 32, 0.85);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      }

      .nav-wrapper {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;

        padding: 22px 0;
      }

      .logo {
        font-size: 26px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      }

      .logo span {
        color: #60a5fa;
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 28px;
      }

      .nav-links a {
        color: #cbd5e1;
        font-size: 16px;
        transition: 0.3s;
      }

      .nav-links a:hover {
        color: white;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 120px 0 100px;
        position: relative;
      }

      .hero::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        width: 500px;
        height: 500px;
        background: #2563eb;
        filter: blur(140px);
        opacity: 0.15;
        top: -100px;
        left: -120px;
      }

      .hero-content {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
      }

      .hero-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 10px 18px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.12);
        border: 1px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.25);
        color: #93c5fd;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 72px;
        line-height: 1.1;
        max-width: 900px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }

      .hero p {
        color: #94a3b8;
        font-size: 20px;
        line-height: 1.8;
        max-width: 780px;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
      }

      .hero-buttons {
        display: flex;
        gap: 18px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .primary-btn {
        background: #2563eb;
        color: white;
        padding: 15px 28px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: 0.3s;
      }

      .primary-btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        background: #1d4ed8;
      }

      .secondary-btn {
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        color: white;
        padding: 15px 28px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .subjects {
        padding: 40px 0 80px;
      }

      .section-title {
        font-size: 38px;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }

      .section-subtitle {
        color: #94a3b8;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
        font-size: 18px;
      }

      .subjects-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
        gap: 24px;
        width: 100%;
      }

      .subject-card {
        background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
        border-radius: 24px;
        padding: 30px;
        transition: 0.3s;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        height: 100%; /* Ensures the card takes full grid height */
      }

      .subject-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-6px);
        border-color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.35);
      }

      .subject-card h3 {
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        font-size: 24px;
      }

      .subject-card p {
        color: #94a3b8;
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        flex-grow: 1; /* Pushes the read-more link exactly to the bottom */
      }

      .subject-card .read-more {
        margin-top: auto;
        align-self: flex-start;
      }

      .posts {
        padding: 20px 0 120px;
      }

      .posts-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
        gap: 28px;
      }

      .post-card {
        background: linear-gradient(180deg, #111827, #0f172a);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        border-radius: 28px;
        overflow: hidden;
        transition: 0.3s;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        height: 100%;
      }

      .post-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-6px);
      }

      .post-banner {
        height: 220px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #7c3aed);
      }

      .post-content {
        padding: 28px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        flex-grow: 1;
      }

      .post-tag {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 13px;
        padding: 8px 14px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.12);
        color: #93c5fd;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        align-self: flex-start;
      }

      .post-content h3 {
        font-size: 28px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }

      .post-content p {
        color: #94a3b8;
        line-height: 1.8;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        flex-grow: 1; /* Pushes the read-more link to the bottom in latest articles too */
      }

      .read-more {
        color: #60a5fa;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      
      .post-content .read-more {
        margin-top: auto;
        align-self: flex-start;
      }

      footer {
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        padding: 30px 0;
        color: #94a3b8;
        text-align: center;
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .nav-wrapper {
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 20px;
        }

        .hero {
          padding-top: 80px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
          font-size: 48px;
        }

        .hero p {
          font-size: 18px;
        }

        .section-title {
          font-size: 32px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <nav>
      <div class="container nav-wrapper">
        <div class="logo">Krish <span>Tech</span></div>

        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="#">Home</a>
          <a href="#">Subjects</a>
          <a href="#">Articles</a>
          <a href="#">About</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-content">
        <div class="hero-badge">
          Interview-focused developer learning platform
        </div>

        <h1>Master Java, Spring Boot & System Design Through Real Examples</h1>

        <p>
          Structured tutorials, interview questions, production-ready examples,
          and real-world fixes for developers preparing for jobs and building
          modern applications.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-buttons">
          <a href="#" class="primary-btn">Start Learning</a>
          <a href="#" class="secondary-btn">Explore Articles</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="subjects">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Subjects</h2>

        <p class="section-subtitle">
          Learn step-by-step with structured topics and interview-focused
          explanations.
        </p>

        <div class="subjects-grid">
          <div class="subject-card">
            <h3>Java</h3>

            <p>
              Collections, streams, multithreading, exception handling and core
              interview concepts.
            </p>

            <a href="/java" class="read-more"> Explore Topics → </a>
          </div>

          <div class="subject-card">
            <h3>Spring Boot</h3>
            <p>
              REST APIs, security, JWT authentication, microservices and
              production-ready architecture.
            </p>
            <a href="#" class="read-more"> Explore Topics → </a>
          </div>

          <div class="subject-card">
            <h3>Angular</h3>
            <p>
              Components, RxJS, routing, state management and real interview
              preparation.
            </p>
            <a href="#" class="read-more"> Explore Topics → </a>
          </div>

          <div class="subject-card">
            <h3>DevOps</h3>
            <p>
              Docker, Jenkins, CI/CD pipelines, deployment workflows and cloud
              concepts.
            </p>
            <a href="#" class="read-more"> Explore Topics → </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="posts">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Latest Articles</h2>

        <p class="section-subtitle">
          Real-world tutorials, debugging fixes and interview-focused content.
        </p>

        <div class="posts-grid">
          <div class="post-card">
            <div class="post-banner"></div>

            <div class="post-content">
              <div class="post-tag">Java Threads</div>

              <h3>Complete Guide to Threads in Java with Real Examples</h3>

              <p>
                Learn how Java threads work, how multithreading improves
                performance and how to create thread-based applications with
                working examples.
              </p>

              <a href="#" class="read-more">Read Article →</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="post-card">
            <div class="post-banner"></div>

            <div class="post-content">
              <div class="post-tag">Multithreading</div>

              <h3>Synchronization in Java Threads Explained Clearly</h3>

              <p>
                Understand race conditions, synchronized methods and thread-safe
                programming with interview-oriented examples and explanations.
              </p>

              <a href="#" class="read-more">Read Article →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div class="container">© 2026 Krish Tech</div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>